     "alt": "",
     "w": 955,
     "h": 537,
     "title": "Clamping tools securely",
     "caption": "<figcaption> <h3>Clamping tools securely</h3> <p>The clamping nut is screwed into the screwdriving station by rotating the »ace« high-precision spindle with dual drive according to the predefined torque and the tool is clamped.</p> </figcaption>"
    },
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/4/a/csm_torquematic_apaptYourHolder_90da281106.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 955,
     "h": 537,
     "title": "»adaptYourHolder« quick-change system",
     "caption": "<figcaption> <h3>»adaptYourHolder« quick-change system</h3> <p>With the help of the »adaptYourHolder« quick-change system, »torquematic« adapts to the shapes of the union nuts of your clamping systems.</p> </figcaption>"
    }
